    <section class="relative text-white min-h-200 bg-gray-950 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0">
            <div class="absolute -top-1/2 left-1/2 w-[1000px] h-[1000px] bg-nst-coral rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl transform -translate-x-1/2"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto text-center px-4 py-24">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-4">Powerful Compute.<br />Personalized Cloud.</h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                High-performance infrastructure for startups, developers, and enterprises — hosted and managed by NSTUDIOS.
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 mb-16">
                <a href="#" class="bg-nst-coral text-white px-6 py-3 rounded shadow font-semibold">Deploy Now</a>
                <a href="#" class="border border-nst-coral text-nst-coral px-6 py-3 rounded font-semibold">View Pricing</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Eye-catching Visual Element -->
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-nst-coral/20 to-transparent border border-nst-coral/30 rounded-xl shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm">
      <pre class="text-left text-sm md:text-base text-gray-200 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
> nstudios deploy web-hosting --type=wordpress
✔ Launching VM instance...
✔ Configuring firewall rules...
✔ Deploying container stack...
✔ Setting up secure container...
✔ Applying CDN + SSL + Backup...
→ Done! Your app is live at: https://yourapp.nstudios.cloud
      </pre>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!--<section id="panel-compute" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-compute">-->

        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight">Simple, Transparent Pricing.</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4">Pay only for what you use. No hidden fees, no surprises.</p>
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-10">
        <div class="grid gap-6 mt-6 md:grid-cols-3">
            <Card title="Small VM"
                  price="15"
                  items={["2 vCPU", "4 GB RAM", "80 GB SSD"]}/>
            <Card title="Medium VM"
                  price="40"
                  items={["4 vCPU", "8 GB RAM", "160 GB SSD"]}/>
            <Card title="Large VM"
                  price="90"
                  items={["8 vCPU", "16 GB RAM", "320 GB SSD"]}/>
        </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-gray-900/50 text-white py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">What We Offer</h2>
            <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
                NSTUDIOS provides the tools, infrastructure, and support you need to build, scale, and grow. Whether you're launching your first app or migrating enterprise workloads — we've got your back.
            </p>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Cloud Web Hosting</h3>
                    <p class="mb-2">Run your websites and apps on our secure, fast, and scalable hosting platform optimized for performance and uptime.</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm">
                        <li>Optimized for WordPress, static sites, and custom apps</li>
                        <li>Daily backups, global CDN, and SSL included</li>
                        <li>Developer-friendly tools: Git, CLI, and one-click staging</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Fully Managed VPS Hosting <span class="italic text-gray-500">(Coming Soon)</span></h3>
                    <p>Complete root access, dedicated resources, and optional managed services so you can focus on building.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Application Deployment <span class="italic text-gray-500">(Coming Soon)</span></h3>
                    <p>Deploy Docker, Node.js, Python, or Go apps with ease using pre-configured environments and Git-based workflows.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Networking & Security <span class="italic text-gray-500">(Coming Soon)</span></h3>
                    <p>Private networking, firewalls, and DDoS protection — secure and performant cloud infrastructure.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Dedicated & Bare Metal Servers <span class="italic text-gray-500">(Coming Soon)</span></h3>
                    <p>Raw compute for high-demand workloads like AI, rendering, and analytics.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>



    <section class=" py-16 px-6 md:px-12">
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-nst-coral/10 to-white/5 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-nst-coral/30 shadow-xl max-w-5xl mx-auto">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 items-center gap-8">
                <div class="text-left">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Web Hosting</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Boost your online visibility and give your business a good name. Secure your space on the web.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="inline-block bg-nst-coral text-white px-5 py-2 rounded font-semibold">Host and Scale</a>
                </div>
                <div class="relative">
                    <img src="/public/test-image.png" alt="Web Hosting Preview" class="rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-white/10" />
                    <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-green-500 text-xs text-white font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded">SSL Active</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
